          "name": "What standards support your data handling process?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS uses documented processes aligned with NIST SP 800-88 media sanitization guidance and supports HIPAA-focused disposal workflows. Chain-of-custody and reporting documentation help Bakersfield organizations maintain records for internal information-security and environmental requirements. Project planning can include inventory detail, handling requirements, and Certificate of Destruction expectations before electronics are collected."
