            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Collected equipment moves through STS's documented handling process. Devices requiring data destruction are managed according to the selected service scope before materials enter appropriate downstream recycling and recovery channels. Bakersfield organizations can discuss inventory, documentation, and equipment-specific handling requirements before collection."
          }
        }
